                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c84db0b-2509-439d-8cc3-359471cf702d",
                                "sense_id": "ff99933f-d555-30b1-bb47-ebfa92c78129",
                                "text": "My grandmother said being organized led to success, so I set out to turn our fridge into a liquid dieter's paradise. First was detoxing the kitchen. I tossed out everything that would lead to temptation, like the leftover candy from Halloween, as well as everything that was expired and rotten."
